# Development-only surfaces of the (shared) webview dist. These are the
# paths the files really have: the two rules that used to sit here named them
# one directory too high, so they never matched anything and both files shipped.
# Not listed: webview/dist/browserSidecar-test.js. Despite its name it is the
# lazy chunk of a production module (lib/browserSidecar) the workbench loads.
